From 3d0806dfdcb7f18bb5a732e2b00d874d37043e52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mr_Hall <174105745+MrHallM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:06:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/19] Update esp32-camera 2.0.15 -> 2.1.8

Picks up the cam_hal robustness fixes (bounded cam_take instead of
recursion, SOI/EOI bounds checks, DMA slot-size guard). Same fps and
image on a XIAO OV2640: 66.8 fps at 240x240, gain still applies.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 dependencies.lock | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dependencies.lock b/dependencies.lock
index 6966af1..5c88a6b 100644
--- a/dependencies.lock
+++ b/dependencies.lock
@@ -10,12 +10,29 @@ dependencies:
       type: service
     version: 1.1.1
